00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,453
A traffic police checkpoint on the Ring Road, late on a Saturday night.

2
00:00:04,453 --> 00:00:08,489
The officer hands the driver a small tube to breathe into.

3
00:00:08,489 --> 00:00:14,908
Inside the old style tube are orange crystals of acidified potassium dichromate.

